L385: ## Appendix A More Implementation Details
L386: 
L387: All the experiments are done on a single Nvidia H200 GPU. We utilze huggingface Transformers libraries  [cite196†51 ] for our implementation.
L388: For baseline implementations, we followed a combination of the Hugging Face implementation and original implementations of baselines. For DoLa, we utilize the Hugging Face implementation for the generation task, and for MC task, we utilize the original implementation provided by the official code repository (https://github.com/voidism/DoLa). For DeCoRe, both generation task and MC task, we utilize the original implementation provided by the official code repository (https://github.com/aryopg/DeCoRe).

